      "message": "\u003e This is exactly what Result\u003cu64\u003e means 😊\n\nAh, I said function but I meant the HVC.\n\n\u003e  assigned as a group with all the other devices in said page but doesn\u0027t cover the whole page\n\nDo you mean that 2 VMs or host and a VM would share part of a page of the MMIO of the device?",
